  "details": "If a User late joins with an Avatar that has the Suggestive tag set,\n\nand the Local user has Suggestive hidden with the Gating Filter, the late User fails to initialize fully with only their Pill & Voice working,\n\nthe Nameplate, Error Robot, and Spawn Animations fail to load.\n\n1. Enable Suggestive Content Filter Locally\n\n2. Have a secondary User *in another Instance* change into a Avatar with Suggestive tag set\n\n3. Have the secondary User join your Instance.",
